// Owner-authz v2 is deliberately a one-action rule pack.
//
// PURGE is action value 1 in heddle-api 0.15. Ordinary redact, visibility,
// attachment, and metadata writes are transport spool-write decisions and
// can never be derived from an owner capability. The exact selector flag is
// false because purge is direct-only and bound to one spool target.
owner_purge($spool, $path) <- owner_grant($spool, $path, false, 1);
